            {
                "id": "ranger-phb:deft-explorer-improvement",
                "name": "Deft Explorer Improvement",
                "level": 6,
                "source": "TCE",
                "text": "You gain an additional benefit when you reach 6th level in this class.\n\n**Roving.** Your walking speed increases by 5, and you gain a climbing speed and a swimming speed equal to your walking speed.\n\n**Deft Explorer Improvement.** You gain an additional benefit when you reach 10th level in this class.\n\n**Tireless.** As an action, you can give yourself a number of temporary hit points equal to 1d8 + your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1 temporary hit point). You can use this action a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.\n\nIn addition, whenever you finish a short rest, your exhaustion level, if any, is decreased by 1.",
                "optional": true,
                "category": "traits"
